1
00:00:00,797 --> 00:00:03,667
(Raj:)Congratulations.
Does it have that new-car smell?

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,430
(Howard:)Yep. For as long
as I can keep my mother out of it.

3
00:00:07,103 --> 00:00:11,133
If you wanna check it out later,
it's parked right out front, Space 294.

4
00:00:11,374 --> 00:00:14,674
- I'm sorry, 294?
- Yeah.

5
00:00:14,911 --> 00:00:16,881
(Sheldon:)That's my parking spot.

6
00:00:18,281 --> 00:00:21,611
(Raj:)Why do you have a parking spot?
You don't have a car. You don't drive.

7
00:00:21,818 --> 00:00:24,308
(Sheldon:)It doesn't matter. That's my spot.

8
00:00:25,588 --> 00:00:27,888
(Leonard:)Maybe they reassigned it
because you never use it.

9
00:00:28,091 --> 00:00:31,621
(Sheldon:)I'm not using my nipples either.
Maybe they should reassign those.

10
00:00:32,528 --> 00:00:36,128
(Howard:)Sheldon, someday, if you get a car...

11
00:00:36,332 --> 00:00:38,662
(Howard:)...I'm sure they'll give you
another parking space.

12
00:00:38,901 --> 00:00:41,931
(Sheldon:)I don't want another parking space.
I want my parking space.

13
00:00:42,138 --> 00:00:46,198
Well, it's perfect. It's a corner spot,
cutting the risk of door dings in half.

14
00:00:46,442 --> 00:00:48,602
(Sheldon:)It's a mere 28 steps
from the building entrance.

15
00:00:48,811 --> 00:00:52,141
(Sheldon:)The nearby tree provides shade
on hot days...

16
00:00:52,348 --> 00:00:55,048
(Sheldon:)...and is also home
to a delightful squirrel...

17
00:00:55,284 --> 00:00:59,274
(Sheldon:)...which is fortuitous
because most squirrels are real jerks.

18
00:01:01,958 --> 00:01:05,118
(Howard:)Fun story.
Meanwhile, you still don't have a car.

19
00:01:05,328 --> 00:01:06,818
(Sheldon:)Don't try to change the subject.

20
00:01:07,029 --> 00:01:10,329
(Sheldon:)This is about a parking space.
It has nothing to do with cars.

21
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:12,570
(Howard:)Are you listening to yourself?

22
00:01:12,802 --> 00:01:15,792
(Sheldon:)I always listen to myself.
It's one of the great joys of my life.

23
00:01:16,239 --> 00:01:19,799
(Sheldon:)- Now get your car out of my spot.
- Nope.

24
00:01:20,009 --> 00:01:23,039
(Sheldon:)Very well, you leave me no choice.

25
00:01:29,385 --> 00:01:34,035
(Sheldon:)What are you looking at,
you stupid squirrel?

